  "label": "Hijab as Fashion Statement",
  "description": "The hijab, while a religious head covering for Muslim women, has increasingly become a global fashion accessory. In contemporary fashion, it is often styled in creative, modern ways to express personal identity, cultural pride, and individuality. The meme implicitly references this trend, where the hijab is not seen as a religious symbol alone but as part of a broader, fashionable, and empowering aesthetic. This requires background knowledge of the evolving role of the hijab in global fashion and identity politics.",
